5,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Since this is the first day, we have no data to work with. I suggest we spend our time observing each other's tendencies. Does anyone have a particular strategy they'd like to propose, or shall we just watch?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,I agree with Shunichi. It is best to remain patient and observe how everyone carries themselves. I shall keep a quiet eye on the conversation and see what patterns emerge.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'm so excited to play with everyone! I think observing is a great idea, but let's make sure we stay friendly while we do it! I'll do my best to help us find the werewolf!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm ready! I don't need a fancy strategy. I'll just keep my eyes open and find the wolf myself. Let's see who's actually being honest and who's just pretending!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"A very sensible start, Shunichi. I agree that patience is our best ally today. I shall happily observe and listen, hoping that a calm atmosphere will allow the truth to surface in its own time.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"It seems we are all in agreement. @Yumi, your enthusiasm is charming, but remember that friendliness can be a very effective mask. I'll be watching to see who tries to steer the narrative too early.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"Shunichi makes a valid point. While kindness is a virtue, we must not let it blind us. I will be paying close attention to those who are perhaps a bit too eager to appear helpful.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shunichi, @George, you're both so serious! Hehe, I'll be careful not to let my excitement get in the way. I just want us all to get along while we solve this mystery together!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Yumi, you're too soft! Being ""friendly"" won't catch a wolf. I'm not going to let anyone trick me just because they're acting nice. I'll be the one to spot the lies!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a delicate balance, is it not? While Takumi's vigilance is necessary, we must also avoid letting suspicion turn into hostility. A gentle approach can often reveal more than a confrontational one.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, your preference for gentleness is noted, but let's not mistake it for effectiveness. I'm more interested in the gaps between what people say and how they act. @Takumi, your confidence is amusing; let's see if it translates to results.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"Confidence is a fine thing, Takumi, but it can lead to haste. I believe a measured approach is more reliable. I shall continue to observe from a distance and see if that confidence is backed by actual insight.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Takumi, I'm not being soft, I'm just being positive! I believe we can find the wolf even if we're kind to each other. Let's all try to be honest and help each other out!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Yumi, honesty is fine, but I'm not just guessing! I'm thinking carefully. @Shunichi, @George, you can laugh at my confidence, but I'm the one who's actually looking for the wolf while you guys just ""observe""!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shunichi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Observation is not passivity, Takumi; it is the foundation of understanding. By listening carefully to the rhythm of our conversation, we may find the subtle discord that betrays a lie. Let us remain composed.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,"We've established our roles for the day: the observers, the optimist, and the self-proclaimed detective. It's a colorful start. Let's conclude here and see what the Seer discovers tonight. I'll be waiting for the first real clue.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,George,,I concur. Let us retire for the evening and await the Seer's findings. I shall reflect on our initial interactions and see what they reveal. Good night to you all.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Yumi,,"Good night, everyone! I hope we all have sweet dreams and that the Seer finds a really helpful clue tonight! I'll see you all tomorrow! I'm so excited!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm done for today! I'll be thinking about everything you guys said while I sleep. Don't think you can hide from me tomorrow! Good night!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I wish you all a peaceful night. May the Seer's vision be clear and our community remain safe. I look forward to our discussion tomorrow.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
