36,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Good morning. The first night has passed, and the Seer now holds the first piece of the puzzle. I'm curious to see who feels confident enough to share their findings or if anyone has already spotted a contradiction.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,George,,"Good morning. I agree with Shunichi. If the Seer is among us and feels it is safe to do so, your guidance would be most welcome. However, we must be mindful of the risks involved in revealing one's identity.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Good morning, everyone! I hope you all slept well! I'm wondering if the Seer found something super helpful last night? I'm a little nervous, but I really want us to find the wolf together!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm awake! Come on, if the Seer knows something, just say it! We can't just sit around ""observing"" forever while the wolf is hiding right in front of us. Who's the wolf? Tell us already!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good morning. Takumi, your eagerness is understandable, but we must be careful. If the Seer reveals themselves too hastily, they become a target. Let us allow them the space to decide when it is safest to speak.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Takumi, your impatience is as predictable as ever. Demanding a reveal doesn't make the truth appear faster; it only makes the Seer's position more precarious. I'm more interested in who is trying to rush us into a blind vote.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,George,,"@Takumi, haste often leads to errors. By pressuring the Seer, you may inadvertently help the werewolf by forcing a reveal that leads to the Seer's death. We should prioritize the Seer's safety over your desire for a quick answer.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Takumi, please don't be so pushy! @Jonathan and @George are right; we have to protect the Seer! If we're too rushed, we might make a mistake, and that would be so sad! Let's just be patient, okay?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Jonathan"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Yumi, I'm not being pushy, I'm being brave! Why is everyone so scared? If the Seer is too afraid to speak, the wolf just wins! I'm not going to let that happen. Who's actually hiding something here?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Bravery is a virtue, Takumi, but in this game, wisdom is more precious. If we act on impulse rather than evidence, we risk losing an innocent soul. Let us listen to the silence and see who feels the need to fill it.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, your poetic approach to silence is a nice touch, but let's be practical. @Takumi, your ""bravery"" is starting to look like a clumsy attempt to create chaos. Is that your strategy, or are you just naturally this loud?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,George,,"@Takumi, whether it is a strategy or nature, the result is the same: you are creating noise that obscures the truth. I find your insistence on a quick reveal quite unsettling. Are you truly brave, or simply impatient?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Takumi, please don't feel bad! I know you just want to help us win, but maybe we can all just take a deep breath? Let's try to be kind to each other so we can think clearly!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, @George, stop talking down to me! I'm not trying to create chaos, I'm trying to get results! You guys just want to hide behind your ""logic"" while the wolf laughs at us. I'm not afraid to call out the liars!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It is unfortunate that our conversation is becoming so heated. @Takumi, your passion is clear, but when we clash, we only provide a screen for the werewolf to hide behind. Perhaps we should return to a more composed dialogue.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"We've reached the end of the day without a Seer's claim. @Takumi, your noise has been the only constant. Since no one is stepping forward, I suggest we vote based on who is most disruptive to our logic. Any final thoughts before we decide?","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,George,,"I believe Shunichi's suggestion is reasonable. While I dislike making decisions based on personality, Takumi's behavior has been counterproductive and disruptive to the Seer's safety. Unless anyone has concrete evidence, he is the most logical choice for today.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"@George, @Shunichi, wait! I don't want to vote for Takumi just because he's loud! He's just really passionate about winning. If we execute someone without a real clue, I'll feel terrible! Can't we just be a little more patient?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Yumi, thanks for having my back! @Shunichi, @George, you're just trying to get rid of me because I'm not playing your boring game! I'm not the wolf, and voting for me is a huge mistake! I'm not giving up!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shunichi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a heavy burden to decide a life based on temperament alone. However, if we must act to preserve the village's stability, Takumi's disruption is a tangible risk. I shall follow the consensus, though my heart remains uneasy.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
